@DomiBase.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080
@AdminToken = replace-with-your-local-admin-token

### Liveness
GET {{DomiBase.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Readiness (checks the control database)
GET {{DomiBase.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Control Plane (requires the admin token; 501 until Phase 3)
GET {{DomiBase.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/projects
Accept: application/json
X-DomiBase-Admin-Token: {{AdminToken}}

### Control Plane without token (expects 401)
GET {{DomiBase.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/projects
Accept: application/json

### Runtime Plane (501 until Phase 4)
GET {{DomiBase.Api_HostAddress}}/rest/v1/contactos
Accept: application/json
apikey: db_public_example
